"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっとお話したい！ って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな照れ屋で口下手な私が言うの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックリすることだけど、(´^^`; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に、みなさん感謝ですペコリーノですトスカーナです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/09/30/3187810/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたし、謝らなきゃいけないことがあってね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、みり愛ちゃんが、休憩時間 一緒に写真撮ってもいいですか～？って、話しかけてくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫だよ♪有難う～って言ったのに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間がなくなっちゃって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真、撮れなかったんです(´+ω+｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから会えずじまいで..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにごめんね(*´pq｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ、連絡先を交換できていないので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この場を借りてお詫びを..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/09/30/3187810/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒に写真撮れたら嬉しいなっ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、みなさん、髪型のこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々お返事くれて有難う ( ﹡ˆoˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","tex